  {"comment": "Replace face onto a curved target (P5): Sketch8 F25, Extrude10 F26 a block at x = 700; Cylinder1 F27 along X through (y, z) = (20, 0), R = 30 (a fixed plane x = 690, whose frame has x along +Y and y along +Z); ReplaceFace2 F28 its top onto the cylinder: z = sqrt(900 - (y - 20)^2), V = 60 (20 sqrt(500) + 900 asin(2/3))."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F25", "corner": [700, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F25", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": {"origin": [690, 0, 0], "normal": [1, 0, 0]},
    "center": [20, 0], "diameter": 60, "height": 80, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "replace_face", "body": "F26.b0",
    "faces": ["F26:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"],
    "target": {"body": "F27.b0", "face": "F27:side0"}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "ReplaceFace2", "status": "ok", "body": "F26.b0", "volume": 66238.10916625366, "faces": 6,
    "has_face": "F28:replace(F26:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}))",
    "has_edge": "E{F26:side(c1[c4,c2])|F28:replace(F26:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}))}"}},

  {"comment": "A curved face replaced: Sketch9 F29 a 20 mm circle at (850, 20), Extrude11 F30 a pin 20 high; Cylinder2 F31 a coaxial 24 mm cylinder 30 high; ReplaceFace3 F32 the pin's side onto it: the ends grow with it, pi 144 20."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F29", "center": [850, 20], "diameter": 20},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F29", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": "xy",
    "center": [850, 20], "diameter": 24, "height": 30, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "replace_face", "body": "F30.b0", "faces": ["F30:side(c1)"],
    "target": {"body": "F31.b0", "face": "F31:side0"}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "ReplaceFace3", "status": "ok", "body": "F30.b0", "volume": 9047.786842338604, "faces": 3,
    "has_face": "F32:replace(F30:side(c1))", "has_edge": "E{F30:end(r{c1})|F32:replace(F30:side(c1))}"}},
